en click Register. Important: After registering : (1) You will get a confirmation screen, (2) note your User ID and Password, (3) Click on the button \"Go to Personal Information Page\" which returns you to this page , now, (4) IMPORTANT: scroll up a bit and use the log in option above and insert \r\n                  the user ID and password you selected during the registration. (5) This will bring you to your applicant account and now you \r\n                can set up the email alerts and enter/paste in your resume information. (6) Do NOT select \r\n                  as Job Category \"Any Category\" but select \r\n                  the Job Category that best matches your job search . (7) Reminder: Do not register again, but use the Login button. User ID: Please do not\r\n                        use spaces or special characters in your User ID (the\r\n                        software can not handle them) - Thank you. Password: Password: (confirm) E-Mail (required) Applicants: \r\n                Search Jobs - Submit Resume Employers: Search Resumes - Submit Jobs Legal - FAQ UniversityJob.com & www.UniversityJob.com 485 Devon Park Dr., Suite 116, \r\n            Wayne, PA 19087, USA Phone USA (610) 964-9200 Email: info@UniversityJob.com This job search site: UniversityJob.com © 1999- All Rights Reserved. This site powered by Aufrance \r\n            Associates JobSite™ © 1995- UniversityJob.com keywords: teaching jobs, education jobs, university \r\n  jobs, academic jobs, higher education jobs, jobs in education, higher ed jobs, \r\n  engineering jobs, biology jobs, science jobs, chemistry jobs, computer science \r\n  jobs, humanities, library jobs, art, languages, faculty positions, jobs in higher \r\n  education, faculty, professor, teacher, lecturer, teaching, teach, university, \r\n  college, community college, research, k-12, schools, education, jobs, careers, \r\n  positions, employer \r\n  resources human \r\n  resources academic \r\n  jobs search"
